feat: leaderboard, SSE streaming, auto-blog — revenue conversion layer v3

Three new income-driving surfaces deployed:

1. /leaderboard + /api/leaderboard — Public spending leaderboard showing top
   wallets by total USDC spent. Drives social proof and competitive FOMO.
   Wallets masked (6+...+4), txHash fully visible on BaseScan.

2. /api/live/stream — Server-Sent Events endpoint for real-time settlement
   broadcasts. Browser EventSource clients connect here; every new payment
   fires 'settlement.new' event with tool/usd/wallet/txHash. Nginx-compatible
   with X-Accel-Buffering:no + 15s heartbeat. after-settle hook now calls
   sseStream.broadcast() alongside alerts.enqueue() and webhookSubs.deliver().

3. /blog + /blog/:slug — Auto-generated SEO blog posts from trending items.
   lib/auto-blog.js creates markdown + HTML for each hot topic with
   NewsArticle JSON-LD, og tags, internal CTAs back to offer.html. Runs
   every trending cache refresh (top 5 items) via try/catch so it never
   blocks page response. Index at /blog/, individual posts at /blog/:slug.

Additional infrastructure:
- data/blog/, data/webhook-subs.json added to deploy-v6.py protection list
- sitemap.xml updated with /leaderboard (hourly), /blog (daily), /.well-known/mcp
- After-settle hook now triple-fires: alerts.enqueue → webhookSubs.deliver
  → sseStream.broadcast (all fire-and-forget, never block main path)

Verification: final-verify 8/9 PASS (SSE timing-out in test harness is
expected — connection stays open which Node https.get handles poorly; curl
confirms text/event-stream header lands correctly with X-Accel-Buffering:no).
